                <syl /><neume facs="#m-36ecad09-6252-46ff-8d41-a9a0565acf38" type="punctum" xml:id="m-3c66b033-3b80-4b21-ad88-4c46d91db1c2">
                  <nc xml:id="m-1421cd8a-e465-450b-a605-8ec70af872fa" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-26536492-8171-4873-a39e-0744829a0c11">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-551d3d44-48ef-4560-ba71-90254b6870c1" type="punctum" xml:id="m-9ef2c416-b987-473d-b7f6-ed93f891e5ff">
                  <nc xml:id="m-7e638a60-075b-4422-88b5-8ba30b8965b1" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-164622ad-e312-48de-8388-6c85ddd99e23">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-8a10d6e7-7e8f-4e3e-b276-dc945b646efb" type="punctum" xml:id="m-67e6f45f-e479-4eb9-9fe2-0712dd471589">
                  <nc xml:id="m-836d405e-42e2-4037-87be-a7383d5e69c8" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-245384bf-03e9-48c2-aafc-1d7b1b1a8f9c">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-1fc4bc12-ad2b-4b8f-a030-85f6b022690d" type="punctum" xml:id="m-d21237f7-be01-4299-896a-04677dadca86">
                  <nc xml:id="m-6fc2f218-9c62-4496-a332-36d6faf7de37" pname="b" oct="3"><episema xml:id="m-04225fb4-6f9a-4122-84e8-38e9116f1084" form="v" /></nc></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-ee0a3cc2-b921-4b96-b276-d69a629acd4a">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-d5f14790-ccbc-4155-a1e8-59827d577068" type="punctum" xml:id="m-53bd8382-8a97-4293-9720-ff6b7c1e1e6e">
                  <nc xml:id="m-0dd55086-6465-4e66-97e5-c66469d7e766" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-3bd74e96-d1da-4fd4-9995-914546d8e911">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-64308228-5d9b-416e-8f3d-e620923cbba0" type="punctum" xml:id="m-6ed8fdc2-823d-4c75-b8bf-58ae8af05c60">
                  <nc xml:id="m-b590531c-fb52-4eaa-bf25-30a1d0006044" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-d9c6a328-1e77-4507-9660-02888fd3aff8">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-bfa4068a-121a-42cb-a4ed-989edd36bc7d" type="punctum" xml:id="m-38799c62-a5af-4ec1-8b23-d6c555d8e211">
                  <nc xml:id="m-f31201ba-1485-4669-b12b-b4fe0267d03d" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-22d0891b-6d39-43ab-9bc7-cb92601454f6" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-246b60e2-0b15-4402-ac2a-db161f9c00bc" facs="#m-5fbfa7d3-0fdc-48c5-be80-f260b65498ef" form="finalis" /><syllable xml:id="m-c652cd27-b3ec-4dd8-87ea-7649b0f9e94a">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-e04fe3d3-2f31-49f7-81e2-72b1bf1630f5" type="punctum" xml:id="m-beaf03f6-df8f-4cd1-ad78-536ec5e9c7f8">
                  <nc xml:id="m-963f4608-4daf-4492-b494-a80c50751d9b" pname="g" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-8d8a10e1-ba08-4c57-a47d-867defadfe05" /></nc></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-1c072e9f-8002-472d-a601-d5524bda65e7"><lg xml:id="m-8077108e-8d32-41d5-be78-a689e992b0d2"><l xml:id="m-490fc54f-a93b-4417-8255-eddfb06d8eca" facs="#m-721521c0-2d82-4778-8fc4-2dc455e3a35f" label="text-like">omce for the Dead.</l><l xml:id="m-dfbe151f-5565-4e84-996a-e1d189e28074" facs="#m-b36a4e41-147a-4921-a77f-1f64286d7d30" label="ambiguous">1790</l><l xml:id="m-51e431d0-0890-4d66-9384-d44a0e3e93e0" facs="#m-eec01201-bb62-4b75-93b2-8055478f48b0" label="lyrics-like">ti- mé-bo? Flex: tribu-lánti-um me:</l><l xml:id="m-88f25dd7-a8ba-4fe4-bc31-d54576def232" facs="#m-a0bbc41b-9e81-401c-b777-f68e8d446212" label="lyrics-like">2. Dóminus protéctor vitde méae:“a quo trepidábo?</l><l xml:id="m-b6f72093-f3f1-4f63-9a4d-dd954c0f8bc7" facs="#m-e1083d25-b062-453b-ab2c-02dc1192a43e" label="lyrics-like">3. Dum apprópiant super me nocéntes, *ut édant cárnes méas:</l><l xml:id="m-8b90b144-d768-4b83-8a0d-7808e0ca1791" facs="#m-d1e54722-572e-4dbd-b568-000afe4634f9" label="lyrics-like">4. Qui tribulant me inimici méi:* ipsi infirmáti sunt et cecidérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-05d49748-1546-4e46-a13e-1378b6043734" facs="#m-752c4084-0c7e-4842-a712-4d65f0846258" label="lyrics-like">5. Si consístant advérsum me cástra, “ non timébit cor méum.</l><l xml:id="m-d67d335e-1af2-4c66-bffb-2fd256278f5d" facs="#m-9e8d9dee-b660-43d3-9f4a-6af895da03ec" label="lyrics-like">6. Si exsúrgat advérsum me proélium, *in hoc égo sperábo.</l><l xml:id="m-712b1c11-e68c-4da8-83a8-2ab5230d5e10" facs="#m-8d9be9e5-a609-449a-9e93-ee4d91cf89c4" label="lyrics-like">7. Unam pétii a Dómino, hanc requiram:"ut inhábitem in dómo</l><l xml:id="m-f08080fb-41cb-4bbe-bf66-aaefb47a0ab6" facs="#m-716b0b10-b0f1-4116-a42e-e1f05e5c0e68" label="lyrics-like">Dómini ómnibus diébus vitae méae:</l><l xml:id="m-ceee5e94-d959-411d-96f7-0550ee885ddc" facs="#m-9f547916-2237-4d19-a2de-774c8739fbe5" label="lyrics-like">8. Ut videam voluptátem Dómini, * et vísitem témplum éius.</l><l xml:id="m-2c96d2b8-3ed8-483b-a71d-0e203078b18e" facs="#m-e2d1d6e3-eed1-49d1-a3bc-a29be939f9b3" label="lyrics-like">9. Quóniam absçóndit me in tabernáculo súo:“in die malórum</l><l xml:id="m-719ab055-b08c-42f5-b919-22f5c44e51e8" facs="#m-5892fb24-40bd-4ff0-9a62-baead47b6445" label="lyrics-like">protéxit me in abscóndito tabernáculi súi.</l><l xml:id="m-03c91198-ef21-4f17-94ce-673755f24b4d" facs="#m-93717c44-9ac2-45cd-a32a-973498496d06" label="lyrics-like">10. In pétra exaitávit me:* et nunc exaltávit cáput méum super</l><l xml:id="m-828af407-7aac-44a9-9969-c0bbad20e790" facs="#m-e7a243aa-fd9d-4192-b692-0b49c8f30c4a" label="lyrics-like">inimicos méos.</l><l xml:id="m-f857b753-1fa3-458b-9adc-30ce2cb25cc9" facs="#m-1ca41f7e-7029-4fff-8d30-500a6ee01be8" label="lyrics-like">11. Circuivi et immolávi in tabernáculo éjus hóstiam vociferatiónis:"</l><l xml:id="m-59a3d1e5-63b5-46e0-a30f-d13f44dbfce9" facs="#m-01d6552c-0eb7-4a19-9c79-46e1be2a2b91" label="lyrics-like">cantábo, et psálmum dicam Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-7ff204ce-c90a-4000-8079-11f34e4d8ed4" facs="#m-05571f5f-f269-43c8-bf13-24504388f601" label="lyrics-like">12. Exáudi Dómine vócem méam qua clamávi ad te:“miserére mél</l><l xml:id="m-6f88df93-ca4a-41d6-9f9d-107f88418204" facs="#m-7bac39e4-6c69-4471-964f-90d6498db6e3" label="lyrics-like">et exáudi me.</l><l xml:id="m-7405476d-0e0d-4026-8706-c0031760a5de" facs="#m-7119167e-e416-4187-8204-09a7deb8e3f7" label="lyrics-like">13. Tibi díxit cor méum, exquisivit te fâcies méa: * fáciem túam</l><l xml:id="m-41927ed5-5810-46c2-8155-8d696b0b226c" facs="#m-14f97b78-8da5-4765-8bb4-57f7dba4d946" label="lyrics-like">Dómine requiram.</l><l xml:id="m-48369faf-b89a-4aad-9142-ba561338580b" facs="#m-43d96531-b3c3-4d51-a882-5c022d26af36" label="lyrics-like">14. Ne avértas fáciem túam a me:*ne declines in ira a sérvo túo.</l><l xml:id="m-5834fb14-4214-4713-a9d3-ee0b5ea80cd5" facs="#m-de0648e4-b693-4eb4-9cd9-4bb0b89b3851" label="lyrics-like">15. Adjútor méus ésto: *ne derelínquas me neque despícias me,</l><l xml:id="m-c1eb89d5-ac09-408e-ad8d-2bc3d8217850" facs="#m-85405660-7364-4e47-b8c8-cbc00dc15caa" label="lyrics-like">Déus satũtaris méus.</l><l xml:id="m-d451dedc-d33d-4e13-8743-50e955768ae6" facs="#m-15d6d711-e3c0-401e-a695-ffd5f8648c03" label="lyrics-like">16. Quóniam páter méus et máter méa dereliquérunt me:* Dóminus</l><l xml:id="m-cccbcda3-a4fa-4ea2-af71-2c18a44f2809" facs="#m-ad80b901-efea-4763-87c8-878a9f236298" label="lyrics-like">autem assúmpsit me.</l><l xml:id="m-629acfff-9691-4aaa-b422-1d4d221e243f" facs="#m-5ba21883-4da0-44ef-9a34-1bd35ac9c4e0" label="lyrics-like">17. Légem póne míhi Dómine in via túa:*et dirige me in sémitam</l><l xml:id="m-9ba264fa-23e0-4978-9634-1075b0122ec0" facs="#m-8b842496-07d9-4ad9-b8c3-768e3f540e97" label="lyrics-like">réctam propter inimicos méos.</l><l xml:id="m-db779568-7ab3-454f-b8fe-28d806c4671e" facs="#m-a8f1d8d4-fc43-44a5-8b9f-1806e8ecb297" label="lyrics-like">18. Ne tradíderis me in ánimas tribulántium me: t quóniam insurre¬</l><l xml:id="m-7cfb4135-116b-408a-a898-d56cd719fc08" facs="#m-1001b398-6422-487c-b204-7c55c76227b4" label="lyrics-like">xérunt in me téstes iniqui, * et mentita est iniquitas sibi.</l><l xml:id="m-ca160e28-a4cb-453d-bf35-99b3ac2333e3" facs="#m-61ae897b-124a-4b82-b1ab-9c67ad239b46" label="lyrics-like">19. Crédo vidére bóna Dómini “ in térra vivéntium.</l><l xml:id="m-1183971f-a74a-4fe2-bbe8-200ac1da6f1b" facs="#m-e2bfbb01-51b9-4ee3-89c3-8c3b4384e214" label="lyrics-like">20. Exspécta Dóminum, virititer âge:"*et confortétur cor túum. et</l><l xml:id="m-b60afecf-7d69-41b4-a03f-63b755f73893" facs="#m-a4d9dc20-1da6-4ead-9177-398638e540cf" label="lyrics-like">sústine Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-cfb4a9c1-2def-458b-8b39-f568201277a2" facs="#m-a894e140-e0a3-4ec4-a3ad-eb634f055f56" label="lyrics-like">21. Réquiem aetérnam* dóna éts Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-1bd67525-db3e-44ff-a2e1-26370e1e9752" facs="#m-8f57e3df-206f-435b-8abd-8029da61829b" label="lyrics-like">22. Et tux perpétua *lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-d6333566-9430-4b2e-8485-fa94f7c23fad" facs="#m-50a2ea07-0b46-4838-a845-d03993c31557" label="lyrics-like">v. Cóllocet é-os Dóminus cum princí-pibus.</l><l xml:id="m-00b93322-e13a-4bce-8f78-448cebc4051b" facs="#m-0c25f4c7-2030-4b34-9afc-a8091a277bcb" label="lyrics-like">W. Cum princí-pibus pópu-li sú¬ i</l><l xml:id="m-4ef02748-8a76-4468-846e-8aba3563e273" facs="#m-780c1fa2-1588-417f-8b02-6d0ef31f720e" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster. said altogether in silence.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>